+of building type, so this paper combines them to form a single HOA indicator. Condominiums are typically
+built as multi-family developments, but can be composed of single-family homes (Esquivel and Alvayay,
+2014). It seems more informative to distinguish between physical form of housing developments rather than
+legal forms, as described below.
+13ZTRAX geocodes are “enhanced Tiger coordinates.” This means each block face is located using Census
